## Soft alternating bells — 25 seconds
##
## A low bell passes between the ears every 625 ms over quiet pink noise.
## Swap shape=bell for shape=tone or shape=noise to compare the cues.
## extended syntax: entrain

bells: emdr:420/22 rate0.8 shape=bell pink/14
off: -

00:00:00 bells fade1
00:00:25 off fade1.75
